    <data key="d0">Town Square Community Management Data Analytics Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing real-time operational database streaming into S3 raw zone, data transformation with AWS Glue, star schema staging in Aurora, and delivery to end users via Elastic Beanstalk and CloudFront.</data>
